		{"id":"0d1513d4cbd70d11","type":"text","text":"图象分类项目","x":684,"y":4652,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#00ff9d"},
		{"id":"e3538b4a32f933bc","type":"text","text":"目标检测项目","x":684,"y":4772,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#00ff9d"},
		{"id":"a7d9fdeeb95546b7","type":"text","text":"NLP项目","x":684,"y":4872,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#00ff9d"},
		{"id":"9fe6cc373bbbc31f","type":"text","text":"大模型应用","x":684,"y":4969,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"#00ff9d"},
		{
			"id":"a25effdfa3475705",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"深度学习会学习哪些特征?\n纹理特征:\n轮廓特征:\n语义特征:\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-470,
			"y":4080,
			"width":260,
			"height":130
		},
		{
			"id":"9add63c30ba8ad2a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\na = torch.tensor([1, 2, 3])\nb = torch.tensor([3, 2, 1])\na > b            # tensor([False, False, True])\ntorch.eq(a, b)   # 相等\ntorch.all(a > 0) # 全部为真？\ntorch.any(a > 2) # 存在为真？\n(a == b).sum()   # 统计相等个数，常用\ntorch.where(a > 1, a, torch.zeros_like(a))  # 条件选择\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1695,
			"y":2781,
			"width":560,
			"height":100,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{"id":"3317562796b4c74a","type":"text","text":"常用组件","x":314,"y":2618,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{
			"id":"73d30ae7419a54ec",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\nx = torch.randn(2, 3)          # float32\nx.long()                       # int64\nx.int()                        # int32\nx.float()                      # float32\nx.double()                     # float64\nx.to(torch.float16)\nx.type(torch.int64)            # 老写法，to 更推荐\nx.cpu()\nx.cuda()                       # 有 GPU 才行\nx.to(\"cuda:0\")\nx.to(device=\"cuda\", dtype=torch.float16)  # 一步到位，推荐\n```\n\n整型张量不能直接 `mean()`、不能求导，记得先 `.float()`。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1695,
			"y":2914,
			"width":560,
			"height":100,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"2ece1ed7de4a4c97",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\nx = torch.tensor([1., 2., 3.])\nx.add_(1)          # 就地加，x 被改\nx.mul_(2)\nx.zero_()          # 全置 0\nx.fill_(7)         # 全填 7\n```\n\n**坑**：in-place 会破坏自动求导图，叶子张量（`requires_grad=True`）尽量别 in-place，否则 backward 可能报 “a leaf Variable that requires grad is being used in an in-place operation”。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1695,
			"y":3054,
			"width":560,
			"height":140,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"09ed1db772ac5c47",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\nx = torch.randn(3, requires_grad=True)\ny = (x ** 2).sum()\ny.backward()\nprint(x.grad)          # dy/dx\nx.detach()             # 脱离计算图，共享内存\nwith torch.no_grad():  # 上下文内不记录梯度，推理时用\n    z = x * 2\nx.requires_grad_(False) # 就地关闭\n```\n\n推理/评估阶段一定要 `torch.no_grad()`，不然显存白涨。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1695,
			"y":3254,
			"width":560,
			"height":120,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{"id":"bcb4b6c685da8704","type":"text","text":"nn.Dropout/nn.BatchNorm","x":649,"y":2618,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"7f9b6f2a8259daef","type":"text","text":"torch.optim(各种优化器)","x":649,"y":2748,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{
			"id":"5104ff692a7de616",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# 如何评估深度学习模型的性能\n1)选择适当的评估指标:\n·分类问题:对于二分类问题,常用的评估指标包括准确率(Accuracy),精确率(Precision),召回率(Recall),F1-score等;对于多分类问题,还可以使用宏平均(Macro Average)和微平均(Micro Average)等。\n·回归问题:常用的评估指标包括均方误差(MSE),均方根误差(RMSE),平均绝对误差(MAE),决定系数(R²)等。\n\n2)划分数据集:\n\n· 训练集:用于训练模型。\n·验证集:用于调参和模型选择,避免过拟合。\n·测试集:用于最终评估模型性能,确保模型在未见过的数据上也有良好的表现。\n\n3)计算并报告指标:\n\n· 可以使用现成的库来计算这些指标,比如Scikit-learn中的classification_report和confusion_matrix函数。\n· 同时注意要报告并解释这些指标,比如是采用平均值、方差还是其他统计量来描述模型性能。\n\n4)混淆矩阵:\n\n· 混淆矩阵不仅可以帮助我们了解模型的分类能力,还能直观地反映出模型在哪些类别上存在误差。\n· 在多分类问题中,混淆矩阵的应用尤为重要,可以帮助找到常见的误分类情况,从而针对性地改进模型。\n\n5)交叉验证:\n\n· 常见的方法有k折交叉验证(k-Fold Cross Validation)和留一法交叉验证(Leave-One-Out CrossValidation) .\n·交叉验证不仅能给出性能指标的平均值,还能提供方差等信息,有助于理解模型的稳定性。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-410,
			"y":4290,
			"width":260,
			"height":190
		},
		{
			"id":"da79850f6187b117",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\na = torch.tensor([1., 2., 3.])\nb = torch.tensor([4., 5., 6.])\na + b; a - b; a * b; a / b       # 逐元素\na ** 2; torch.pow(a, 2)          # 幂\ntorch.sqrt(a)  # 平方根\ntorch.exp(a)  # e的a次方\ntorch.log(a)  # 自然对数\ntorch.abs(a)  # 取绝对值\ntorch.neg(a)  # 取负\n# 矩阵乘\nm1 = torch.randn(2, 3)\nm2 = torch.randn(3, 4)\nm1 @ m2                          # 推荐写法\ntorch.matmul(m1, m2)\ntorch.mm(m1, m2)                 # 只能二维\nm1.mean(dim=0)                   # 按列计算均值\nm1.mean(dim=1)                   # 按行计算均值\n# 批量矩阵乘\nbatch1 = torch.randn(10, 2, 3)\nbatch2 = torch.randn(10, 3, 4)\ntorch.bmm(batch1, batch2)        # [10,2,4]\n```\n\n**广播规则**：从右往左对齐，维度相等或其中一个为 1 就能广播。\n\n```python\ntorch.randn(3, 4) + torch.randn(4)     # ✅ → [3,4]\ntorch.randn(3, 1) + torch.randn(1, 4)  # ✅ → [3,4]\ntorch.randn(3, 4) + torch.randn(3)     # ❌ 3 vs 4 对不上\n```",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1695,
			"y":2424,
			"width":560,
			"height":115,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"bef75fab9b648de0",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"```python\nx = torch.randn(3, 4)\nx.sum()                 # 全部求和，标量\nx.sum(dim=0)            # 沿 dim0 求和 → [4]\nx.sum(dim=1, keepdim=True)  # → [3,1]，保留维度方便广播\nx.mean(); x.median()    # 注意：整型不能 mean，会报错\nx.max(); x.min()\nx.max(dim=1)            # 返回 (values, indices) 命名元组\nx.argmax(dim=1)         # 只返回索引\nx.std(); x.var()\nx.cumsum(dim=0)         # 累加\ntorch.sort(x, dim=1)    # 排序，返回 values 和 indices\n\n```\n**坑**：`x.max(dim=1)` 返回的是 `torch.return_types.max(values=..., indices=...)`，不是单纯张量。要值就 `.values`，要索引就 `.indices`。",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":1695,
			"y":2599,
			"width":560,
			"height":120,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{"id":"5c16dbe99689a46b","type":"text","text":".cuda()和.to(device)","x":649,"y":2871,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"65825068df036b3d","type":"text","text":"多GPU训练","x":649,"y":2963,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{
			"id":"38ea04e978db2e1f",
